WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.153
Miss Gray: It's the moment you've been waiting for, boys and girls.

2
00:00:08.154 --> 00:00:10.511
Daisy: Yay!

3
00:00:10.512 --> 00:00:12.985
Coby: What's our reward, Miss Gray?

4
00:00:12.986 --> 00:00:15.818
Jenna: It had better be a pizza party.

5
00:00:15.819 --> 00:00:18.667
Kara: My idea was much better, Jenna.

6
00:00:18.668 --> 00:00:21.125
I bet it got more votes.

7
00:00:21.126 --> 00:00:26.123
Miss Gray: Our reward will be . . . Silly Hair Day!

8
00:00:26.124 --> 00:00:27.544
Kara: Woo-hoo!

9
00:00:27.545 --> 00:00:30.082
Class: Yay!

10
00:00:30.083 --> 00:00:31.865
Jim: I forget.

11
00:00:31.866 --> 00:00:35.376
What do you do on Silly Hair Day?

12
00:00:35.377 --> 00:00:37.411
Coby: You make your hair look silly!

13
00:00:37.412 --> 00:00:43.268
Mark: Yeah. Last year I made my hair all spiky.

14
00:00:43.269 --> 00:00:45.901
Kara: I made my hair pink.

15
00:00:45.902 --> 00:00:48.858
I looked beautiful.

16
00:00:48.859 --> 00:00:53.220
Jenna: Well, I looked ridiculous!

17
00:00:53.221 --> 00:00:55.691
I hate Silly Hair Day!

18
00:00:55.692 --> 00:01:00.096
Kara: Miss Gray! Jenna isn't being nice about Silly Hair

19
00:01:00.097 --> 00:01:09.651
Day. Miss Gray: Oh. Well, maybe Jenna will change her

20
00:01:09.652 --> 00:01:13.693
mind. Mr. Gibson: Silly Hair Day sounds fun,

21
00:01:13.694 --> 00:01:16.868
Jenna. Jenna: It's not fun,

22
00:01:16.869 --> 00:01:21.097
Dad. I like pretty hair, not silly hair.

23
00:01:21.098 --> 00:01:25.185
Mrs. Gibson: How are you going to make it look silly tomorrow?

24
00:01:25.186 --> 00:01:28.875
Jenna: I'm trying not to think about it.

25
00:01:28.876 --> 00:01:34.112
Mr. Gibson: You could make funny pigtails.

26
00:01:34.113 --> 00:01:43.497
Mrs. Gibson: Or dye your hair pink.

27
00:01:43.498 --> 00:01:46.157
Jenna: No pink!

28
00:01:46.158 --> 00:01:57.491
Mrs. Gibson: Okay. What about purple?

29
00:01:57.492 --> 00:02:02.944
Jenna: That is my favorite color.

30
00:02:02.945 --> 00:02:14.023
Mrs. Gibson: Well, then I have an idea . . .

31
00:02:14.024 --> 00:02:16.554
Kara: Here comes Jenna!

32
00:02:16.555 --> 00:02:23.000
Maya: Ha-ha! Look at her hair!

33
00:02:23.001 --> 00:02:25.721
Coby: She doesn't look very happy.

34
00:02:25.722 --> 00:02:36.567
Mark: Nope. But she looks very silly!

